flowchart TD
  A[Squads: roster + open role] --> B[Run scouting]
  B --> C{Eligible free agents?}
  C -- no --> C1[Empty state]
  C -- yes --> D[Percentile normalise in game+role pool]
  D --> E[Weighted role score + evidence index]
  E --> F[Estimated roster fit]
  F --> G[Ranked table]
  G --> H[Why panel] & I[Compare 2-5] & J[Add to roster]
  J --> K[Squads: coverage updated]
